  {
   "key": "func RouteTRIMPEstimator.estimate(track:sport:recordedTRIMP:recordedDistance:distanceMayBeTruncated:archive:savedRouteStore:)",
   "hash": "124cb825e1afecb3",
   "does": "Matches the track to a saved route, collects prior same-route sessions' TRIMP/metre (outliers removed), compares to today's Lucia TRIMP/metre and returns nil when today's ratio >= 70 % of the prior average; with no priors, also returns nil when the target distance is the recorded distance (today's ratio × today's distance is the recorded TRIMP, nothing to add); otherwise returns the blended/prior/today-scaled estimate scaled to the target distance.",
   "entry": null,
   "calls": [
    "Emuqu/Sources/Analysis/RouteLibrary.swift::func RouteLibrary.findMatch(currentTrack:sport:store:)",
